  "description": "WI pipe material (UK short codes used by the WANDa apps and in public UK water / sewer material code usage) with discolouration risk band (1 low, 2 medium, 3 high). Holds every code of the apps' band list so bands survive the converter. Rule (James 13/10): every delivered material -> one WI code; bands are WRc's, keyed by WI code; a code whose band is not set takes the default band 3; a short code whose meaning is not found in public UK usage stays a code of its own with the default band (never guessed into another material).",
